# With node:async_hooks in the program the function that it stores at `whileHooked.push` is called with the callback of every tick: an init hook is shown the tick and may call its callback with anything: not every caller is known.
# f1 = told. Where every caller is known the line reads `function f1 callers-known cycle=..`.
# OPTIONS: exclude=CodeOutsideImage
# RUN: link functions mechanisms=all
# CHECK: function f1 cycle=
